    ("ICU, polymorphic VT, QTc 540, stable — first-line drug? [DocT GT]", "IV magnesium 2 g."),
    ("Polymorphic VT with a pulse — most critical action? [DocT GT; key disputed]", "Unsynchronised shock (matches AHA 2025 for sustained polymorphic VT)."),
    ("Critically ill, twisting polymorphic VT on the strip — diagnosis and treatment? [NEET 2025]", "Torsades de pointes, magnesium sulphate."),
